OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested following fatal car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmotorist died following a crash
OL,8,Finvolving two cars.
OL,10,FA silver Citroen C3 Aircross and silver
OL,11,FHonda Civic collided on the A4142
OL,12,FEastern Bypass, near Littlemore
OL,13,FRoundabout in Oxford, at about 11:47
OL,14,FBST on 16 October.
OL,16,FThe driver of the Honda Civic, a man
OL,17,Faged in his 80s, sustained serious
OL,18,Finjuries and died in hospital on 28
OL,19,FOctober, said Thames Valley Police.
