OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested following fatal car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old man from Witney has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,8,Fby careless driving and causing death
OL,9,Fby driving a vehicle while uninsured.
OL,10,FHe has been released on conditional
OL,11,Fbail while enquiries continue.
